  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Enchantment Spell. For 30 seconds, your melee attacks neither hit nor fail to hit. Instead, Illusionary Weaponry deals 20...52...60 damage to your targets for each melee attack. You have +5 armor for each equipped Illusion Magic skill.",
      "zhTW": "持續 30 秒，依照裝備的幻術屬性魔法數量，每項使你增加 5 防禦。你所有的近身攻擊傷害將被幻象武器取代成 20～60 ，而且近身攻擊不會失誤但也沒有怒氣值。"
    },
    "pvp": {
